+# TABS
+
+A window can hold several terminals (tabs). With more than one, a
+sidebar lists them: click to select, drag to reorder, drag onto the
+terminal to show side by side, drag out to detach, middle-click to
+close, right-click for a menu. The sidebar can be resized, hidden
+and put on either side. See the *tabs* section and the tab actions
+in *foot.ini*(5).
+
 # KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
 
 The following keyboard shortcuts are available by default. They can be
